50 REM
60 REM  Animate the front panel LEDs
70 REM  on an RC2014 Z80 computer
80 REM
90 DELAY=100
100 BIT=1
110 FOR I=1 TO 8
120 OUT 0,BIT
130 BIT=BIT*2
140 FOR J=1 TO DELAY
150 NEXT J
160 NEXT I
170 BIT=BIT\2
210 FOR I=1 TO 6
220 BIT=BIT\2
230 OUT 0,BIT
240 FOR J=1 TO DELAY
250 NEXT J
260 NEXT I
300 GOTO 100